@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Partners
	Frontend testing for the www partners

Scenario: Partners Homepage Navigation
	End users should be able to view all links in the partners homepage.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "partners"
	Then there should be no errors on the page
    When I click on the "Find a Partner" card on the partners homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
	When I go to the www page with the url "partners"
    And I click on the "Become a Partner" card on the partners homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
    When I go to the www page with the url "partners"
    And I click on the "Partner Portal" card on the partners homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"

Scenario: View OG Tags in Partners page
	The partners page og tags should be specific values.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "partners"
	Then the current page og title tag should be "Join the Liferay Partner Ecosystem"
	And the current page og description tag should be "Liferay's Partner Program helps system integrators differentiate themselves in a crowded field as they deliver valuable solutions and provide local support and expertise for our joint clients worldwide. Learn more."
	And the current page og url tag should be "https://www-uat.liferay.com/partners"
	And the current page og image tag should be "https://www-uat.liferay.com/documents/10182/0/open_graph_image+%281%29.png/a608e357-83f6-e392-979c-6599a8618634?version=1.0&t=1646949040894&imagePreview=1"

Scenario: View Partners page hreflang tags
	All hreflang tags on the partners page should be specific values.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "partners"
	Then the hreflang tag for the relative language url "zh/partners" should be "zh"
	And the hreflang tag for the relative language url "es/partners" should be "es"
	And the hreflang tag for the relative language url "en-AU/partners" should be "en-AU"
	And the hreflang tag for the relative language url "ja/partners" should be "ja"
	And the hreflang tag for the relative language url "it/partners" should be "it"
	And the hreflang tag for the relative language url "fr/partners" should be "fr"
	And the hreflang tag for the relative language url "partners" should be "en"
	And the hreflang tag for the relative language url "pt/partners" should be "pt"
	And the hreflang tag for the relative language url "de/partners" should be "de"